<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Third-party licences · Tanki Skin Studio</title>
  <style>
    body { font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 900px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; color: #1a1f1b; background: #f6f7f4; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; } h2 { margin-top: 2rem; } h3 { margin-bottom: .25rem; }
    pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #dfe3da; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem; font-size: 13px; }
    ul.crates { columns: 2; padding-left: 1.2rem; } a { color: #2f6b12; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      body { color: #e6ebe3; background: #0f1410; } pre { background: #151e17; border-color: #263228; } a { color: #a3e635; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Third-party licences</h1>
  <p>Tanki Skin Studio is free software under GPL-3.0-or-later. It is built with the Rust crates
  below, each under its own licence, whose notices follow. The bundled fonts and icons carry their
  licences in the <code>licenses</code> folder beside this file.</p>

  <h2>Overview</h2>
  <ul>
    {{#each overview}}
    <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
    {{/each}}
  </ul>

  <h2>Licences</h2>
  {{#each licenses}}
  <section>
    <h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
    <p>Used by:</p>
    <ul class="crates">
      {{#each used_by}}
      <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
      {{/each}}
    </ul>
    <pre>{{text}}</pre>
  </section>
  {{/each}}
</body>
</html>
